WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:10.920
The summer of 1969, there were four males, young black males, who were killed by the police in Baton Rouge.

2
00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:12.280
Shot in the back.

3
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:16.240
I think they were, all of them, unarmed.

4
00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:20.640
The local police were just shooting black people in the back!

5
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:25.260
They claimed they were burglary suspects, and I wouldn’t be surprised if they had committed burglary,

6
00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:28.300
but they had no chance to defend themselves because they were killed.
